<title>ESTONIA: CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS JUNE 2/3.</title>
<headline>CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS JUNE 2/3.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Estonian central bank</p>
<p>released the following fixings for the Estonian kroon for June</p>
<p>2/3. The Estonian kroon is pegged at eight kroons to a German</p>
<p>mark.</p>
<p>	   June 2/3	  May 30/June 2</p>
<p> CZK	0.41742	   0.41978</p>
<p> DKK	2.10086	   2.1009</p>
<p> FIM	2.65382	   2.65169</p>
<p> HUF	0.07484	   0.07455</p>
<p> JPY	0.11813	   0.11698</p>
<p> LTL	3.43634	   3.39974</p>
<p> LVL     24.01538	  23.78448</p>
<p> RUR	0.00238	   0.00236</p>
<p> SEK	1.77165	   1.75973</p>
<p> UAH	7.38662	   7.30695</p>
<p> USD     13.7428	   13.5964</p>
<p> XEU     15.57953	  15.5672</p>
<p>For a full listing see Bank of Estonia </p>
<p>--Tallinn newsroom, +372 630 8400 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
